        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and mental status"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Elderly male sitting upright, speaking in full sentences, mildly short of breath at rest, appears tired but not toxic; alert and oriented to person, place, and time."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Respiratory effort and chest examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mildly increased work of breathing with mild accessory muscle use; no cyanosis. Chest expansion slightly decreased but symmetrical; percussion resonant. Widespread bilateral expiratory wheeze, coarse crackles and rhonchi in the right mid and lower zones, partly clearing with cough. No focal bronchial breath sounds or pleural rub."
      }
    },
